OL,3,GNEWSAFinucane inquiry to consider
OL,4,A'extent killers were assisted by state'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Pat Finucane inquiry has heard that
OL,7,Fthe "core concern at the heart of his
OL,8,Fmurder" was the "extent to which his
OL,9,Fkillers were encouraged, assisted,
OL,10,Fprotected or directed by the state".
OL,12,FIn his opening statement, counsel to
OL,13,Fthe inquiry, Matthew Hill, said there
OL,14,Fwas "no more serious question" in a
OL,15,Fsociety governed by the rule of law.
OL,17,FThe 39-year-old solicitor was shot dead
OL,18,Fat his home in north Belfast by
OL,19,Floyalist paramilitaries in front of his
OL,20,Fwife and children in February 1989.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
